OL,3,GNEWSAMap thief leads 'merry dance' with
OL,4,Areturn promises
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who used a Stanley knife to cut a
OL,7,Frare 17th Century world map out of an
OL,8,Fatlas at a museum library has been
OL,9,Fjailed for three years.
OL,11,FMelvin West, 70, sliced the map from a
OL,12,F1684 atlas by Dutch cartographer
OL,13,FFrederik de Wit while viewing it at the
OL,14,FCaird Library, part of the National
OL,15,FMaritime Museum in Greenwich, in
OL,16,FFebruary 2025.
OL,18,FThe map has never been found, and a
OL,19,Fjudge at Woolwich Crown Court said West
OL,20,Fhad led the court, police and museum a
OL,21,F"merry dance" over where it was.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
